:1789885153836.1123"],["D:\\maestro-fabric-gui\\.workflow\\specs\\review-standards.md","f:190:1789885153838.1257:1789885153838.1257"],["D:\\maestro-fabric-gui\\.workflow\\specs\\test-conventions.md","f:271:1789885153837.1255:1789885153837.1255"],["D:\\maestro-fabric-gui\\.workflow\\specs\\ui-conventions.md","f:304:1789885153837.1255:1789885153837.1255"],["C:\\Users\\dyw\\.claude\\projects\\D--maestro-fabric-gui","m"],["C:\\Users\\dyw\\.codex\\session_index.jsonl","f:4128:1790056004604.317:1790056004604.317"],["C:\\Users\\dyw\\.codex\\sessions","d:0:1774578062397.4487:1780024421007.607"]],"entries":[{"id":"knowhow-rcp-20260920-github-actions-tauri","type":"knowhow","title":"GitHub Actions Tauri 打包与发布管线","summary":"","tags":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验"],"status":"active","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","updated":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","related":[],"source":{"kind":"file","path":"knowhow/RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri.md"},"body":"\n\n## Goal\n为 Tauri 桌面应用建立可重复的 GitHub 构建、校验与发布流程，并让发布产物进入 draft GitHub Release 供人工复核。\n\n## Prerequisites\n- GitHub Actions 已启用，仓库默认 `GITHUB_TOKEN` 可写 `contents`。\n- Node.js 22、npm lockfile、Rust stable。\n- 发布前 `package.json`、`src-tauri/Cargo.toml`、`src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` 使用同一版本号。\n\n## Steps\n1. 在 PR 或 push 上运行 `npm ci`、`npm run typecheck`、`npm test`、`npm run verify:package` 和 Rust 测试；CI 上传 web package artifact 供检查。\n2. 将三处版本号更新为同一语义化版本，例如 `0.1.0`。\n3. 创建并推送匹配的 tag：`git tag v0.1.0 && git push origin v0.1.0`。\n4. `release.yml` 在 Ubuntu、Windows、macOS 矩阵上安装平台依赖，运行版本校验，然后由 `tauri-apps/tauri-action` 构建安装包。\n5. 工作流创建 draft Release；检查三个平台的附件、版本和安装结果后，在 GitHub 页面手动发布 draft。\n\n## Expected Outcome\nPR/push 有可追踪的构建 artifact；`v*.*.*` tag 生成包含 Linux、Windows、macOS 安装包的 draft GitHub Release；tag 与应用元数据不一致时会在构建前失败。\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n- 不要直接推送与应用版本不一致的 tag；`scripts/verify-release-version.mjs` 会拒绝该发布。\n- Linux runner 必须安装 WebKit、Ayatana、librsvg、patchelf 等 Tauri 依赖。\n- 发布工作流必须保留 `permissions: contents: write`，而普通 CI 只需 `contents: read`。\n- 本地 Windows `npm run tauri build` 成功不代表 Linux/macOS 构建成功，必须等待完整矩阵完成。\n\n## Related\n- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\n- `.github/workflows/release.yml`\n- `scripts/verify-release-version.mjs`\n- `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`\n","ext":{"type":"recipe","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.308Z","keywords":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验"],"language":"zh-CN","lifecycleStatus":"active","relatedPaths":[".github/workflows/ci.yml",".github/workflows/release.yml","scripts/verify-release-version.mjs","src-tauri/tauri.conf.json"]},"scope":null,"category":"recipe","specCategory":null,"createdBy":null,"sourceRef":null,"parent":null,"repoId":null},{"id":"knowhow-RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri-001","type":"knowhow","title":"Goal","summary":"为 Tauri 桌面应用建立可重复的 GitHub 构建、校验与发布流程，并让发布产物进入 draft GitHub Release 供人工复核。","tags":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验","recipe"],"status":"active","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","updated":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","related":[],"source":{"kind":"file","path":"knowhow/RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri.md"},"body":"为 Tauri 桌面应用建立可重复的 GitHub 构建、校验与发布流程，并让发布产物进入 draft GitHub Release 供人工复核。","ext":{"entryType":"general","timestamp":""},"scope":null,"category":"general","specCategory":null,"createdBy":null,"sourceRef":null,"parent":"knowhow-rcp-20260920-github-actions-tauri","repoId":null},{"id":"knowhow-RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri-002","type":"knowhow","title":"Prerequisites","summary":"- GitHub Actions 已启用，仓库默认 `GITHUB_TOKEN` 可写 `contents`。 - Node.js 22、npm lockfile、Rust stable。 - 发布前 `package.json`、`src-tauri/Cargo.toml`、`src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` 使用同一版本号。","tags":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验","recipe"],"status":"active","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","updated":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","related":[],"source":{"kind":"file","path":"knowhow/RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri.md"},"body":"- GitHub Actions 已启用，仓库默认 `GITHUB_TOKEN` 可写 `contents`。\n- Node.js 22、npm lockfile、Rust stable。\n- 发布前 `package.json`、`src-tauri/Cargo.toml`、`src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` 使用同一版本号。","ext":{"entryType":"general","timestamp":""},"scope":null,"category":"general","specCategory":null,"createdBy":null,"sourceRef":null,"parent":"knowhow-rcp-20260920-github-actions-tauri","repoId":null},{"id":"knowhow-RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri-003","type":"knowhow","title":"Steps","summary":"1. 在 PR 或 push 上运行 `npm ci`、`npm run typecheck`、`npm test`、`npm run verify:package` 和 Rust 测试；CI 上传 web package artifact 供检查。 2. 将三处版本号更新为同一语义化版本，例如 `0.1.0`。 3. 创建并推送匹配的 tag：`git tag v0.1.0 && git push origin v0.1.0`。 4. `release.yml` 在 Ubu","tags":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验","recipe"],"status":"active","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","updated":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","related":[],"source":{"kind":"file","path":"knowhow/RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri.md"},"body":"1. 在 PR 或 push 上运行 `npm ci`、`npm run typecheck`、`npm test`、`npm run verify:package` 和 Rust 测试；CI 上传 web package artifact 供检查。\n2. 将三处版本号更新为同一语义化版本，例如 `0.1.0`。\n3. 创建并推送匹配的 tag：`git tag v0.1.0 && git push origin v0.1.0`。\n4. `release.yml` 在 Ubuntu、Windows、macOS 矩阵上安装平台依赖，运行版本校验，然后由 `tauri-apps/tauri-action` 构建安装包。\n5. 工作流创建 draft Release；检查三个平台的附件、版本和安装结果后，在 GitHub 页面手动发布 draft。","ext":{"entryType":"general","timestamp":""},"scope":null,"category":"general","specCategory":null,"createdBy":null,"sourceRef":null,"parent":"knowhow-rcp-20260920-github-actions-tauri","repoId":null},{"id":"knowhow-RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri-004","type":"knowhow","title":"Expected Outcome","summary":"PR/push 有可追踪的构建 artifact；`v*.*.*` tag 生成包含 Linux、Windows、macOS 安装包的 draft GitHub Release；tag 与应用元数据不一致时会在构建前失败。","tags":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验","recipe"],"status":"active","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","updated":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","related":[],"source":{"kind":"file","path":"knowhow/RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri.md"},"body":"PR/push 有可追踪的构建 artifact；`v*.*.*` tag 生成包含 Linux、Windows、macOS 安装包的 draft GitHub Release；tag 与应用元数据不一致时会在构建前失败。","ext":{"entryType":"general","timestamp":""},"scope":null,"category":"general","specCategory":null,"createdBy":null,"sourceRef":null,"parent":"knowhow-rcp-20260920-github-actions-tauri","repoId":null},{"id":"knowhow-RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri-005","type":"knowhow","title":"Common Pitfalls","summary":"- 不要直接推送与应用版本不一致的 tag；`scripts/verify-release-version.mjs` 会拒绝该发布。 - Linux runner 必须安装 WebKit、Ayatana、librsvg、patchelf 等 Tauri 依赖。 - 发布工作流必须保留 `permissions: contents: write`，而普通 CI 只需 `contents: read`。 - 本地 Windows `npm run tauri build` 成功不","tags":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验","recipe"],"status":"active","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","updated":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","related":[],"source":{"kind":"file","path":"knowhow/RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri.md"},"body":"- 不要直接推送与应用版本不一致的 tag；`scripts/verify-release-version.mjs` 会拒绝该发布。\n- Linux runner 必须安装 WebKit、Ayatana、librsvg、patchelf 等 Tauri 依赖。\n- 发布工作流必须保留 `permissions: contents: write`，而普通 CI 只需 `contents: read`。\n- 本地 Windows `npm run tauri build` 成功不代表 Linux/macOS 构建成功，必须等待完整矩阵完成。","ext":{"entryType":"general","timestamp":""},"scope":null,"category":"general","specCategory":null,"createdBy":null,"sourceRef":null,"parent":"knowhow-rcp-20260920-github-actions-tauri","repoId":null},{"id":"knowhow-RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri-006","type":"knowhow","title":"Related","summary":"- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` - `.github/workflows/release.yml` - `scripts/verify-release-version.mjs` - `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`","tags":["github-actions","tauri","发布管线","版本校验","recipe"],"status":"active","created":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","updated":"2026-09-20T06:08:31.312Z","related":[],"source":{"kind":"file","path":"knowhow/RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri.md"},"body":"- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\n- `.github/workflows/release.yml`\n- `scripts/verify-release-version.mjs`\n- `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`","ext":{"entryType":"general","timestamp":""},"scope":null,"category":"general","specCategory